<title>JAPAN: Bridgestone up on weaker yen in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Bridgestone up on weaker yen in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridgestone Corp's shares were sharply higher in Monday afternoon trade, benefiting from the weaker yen against the dollar, brokers said.</p>
<p>By 0356 GMT, shares of the major tyre firm had climbed 80 yen to 2,510.</p>
